 <text>
  <body>
   <p><date when="1861-01-16">16</date> 
<lb/>The <persName ref="cwgk:N00000258">Governor</persName> accepted the resignations of <persName ref="cwgk:N00013976">H. H. Culbertson</persName> <persName ref="cwgk:N00021555">W. H. Cressy</persName>, <persName ref="cwgk:N00021557">Jo<hi rend="sup">s</hi> C. Bailey</persName> &amp; <persName ref="cwgk:N00021554">W. G. Stone</persName>, Capt. 1<hi rend="underline"><hi rend="sup">st</hi></hi> 2<hi rend="underline"><hi rend="sup">d</hi></hi> &amp; 3<hi rend="sup">d</hi> Lieut of the <orgName ref="cwgk:O00000916">Woodford Blues</orgName><pb/></p>
<p><note place="header">161</note></p>
<p><date when="1861">1861</date> Executive Journal</p>
<p><date when="1861-01-16">Jany 16</date> 
<lb/>The Governor approved an account of $87.<hi rend="sup">50</hi>/<hi rend="sub">100</hi> for the Services of three guards at <orgName ref="cwgk:O00010811">State Arsenal</orgName> certified as correct by the <persName ref="cwgk:N00002598">Q<hi rend="underline"><hi rend="sup">r</hi></hi> M<hi rend="underline"><hi rend="sup">r</hi></hi> Genl</persName>.</p>
<p>He issued a Proclamation ordering an election in the county of <placeName ref="cwgk:P001020">Warren</placeName> for Representative in the <orgName ref="cwgk:O00000923">General Assembly</orgName> made vacant by the resignation of <persName ref="cwgk:N00001579">P. Hines</persName> -- Setting forth Saturday Jany. 26<hi rend="underline"><hi rend="sup">th</hi></hi> as the day for said election.</p>
<p>He approved the following accounts, to wit</p>
<p><table rend="rules">
<row>
	<cell><orgName ref="cwgk:O00021551">T. Grimsley &amp; Co</orgName></cell>
	<cell>$5.<hi rend="underline">40</hi></cell>
	<cell>sundries furnished <orgName ref="cwgk:O00000389">Q. M Gen<hi rend="underline"><hi rend="sup">l</hi></hi> Dept.</orgName></cell>
</row>
<row>
	<cell>M. D. West</cell>
	<cell>4.<hi rend="underline">50</hi></cell>
	<cell>Drayage &amp;<hi rend="underline"><hi rend="sup">c</hi></hi></cell>
</row>
<row>
	<cell><persName ref="cwgk:N00021552">Dan<hi rend="underline"><hi rend="sup">l</hi></hi> Welch</persName></cell>
	<cell>2.50,</cell>
	<cell>for gun rack "</cell>
</row>
<row>
	<cell><orgName ref="cwgk:O00010775">Lou &amp;. Lex R. R.</orgName></cell>
	<cell>11.45.</cell>
	<cell>transportation fo Arms</cell>
</row>
<row>
	<cell><persName ref="cwgk:N00021553">Ja<hi rend="underline"><hi rend="sup">s</hi></hi> R. Morgan</persName></cell>
	<cell>$114.00</cell>
	<cell> </cell>
</row>
</table></p>
<p>All duly certified by the Q<hi rend="underline"><hi rend="sup">r</hi></hi> M<hi rend="underline"><hi rend="sup">r</hi></hi> General as correct</p>
  </body>
